flowchart TD
    Start([Receive Input Features]) --> GetProbs[Get Probabilities from XGBoost]
    GetProbs --> GetLoops[Count H1 Loops from TDA Diagram]
    
    GetLoops --> CalcGap[Calculate Confidence Gap:<br/>Max Prob - 2nd Max Prob]
    
    CalcGap --> CheckExtreme{Loops >= 14?}
    CheckExtreme -->|Yes| Ambiguous[Output: AMBIGUOUS<br/>Trigger: Extreme Topology]
    
    CheckExtreme -->|No| CheckMod{Loops >= 10<br/>AND Gap < 0.30?}
    CheckMod -->|Yes| Ambiguous2[Output: AMBIGUOUS<br/>Trigger: Mod Topology + Low Gap]
    
    CheckMod -->|No| CheckLowGap{Gap < 0.10?}
    CheckLowGap -->|Yes| Ambiguous3[Output: AMBIGUOUS<br/>Trigger: Very Low Gap]
    
    CheckLowGap -->|No| FinalEmotion[Output: Highest Probability Emotion]
